                "description": "With its classic beauty, the Victoria Knob with Rope Rosette has an elegance that will be sure to add old world charm to any door in your home. This exquisite pairing of detailed Victoria Knob with Round Rope Rose  comes in all standard functions, dummy, passage, and privacy. Emtek is known for its high quality and attention to detail. Around here, Emtek a favorite brand. The Victoria Knobset with Rope Round Rose is available in several stunning finish color choices. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors.",
